CONTEXT.TargetAudience:
Security students learning Linux reconnaissance techniques in a safe
environment; CTF enthusiasts practicing enumeration methodology; Linux
learners who benefit from seeing real commands used in a narrative context;
creative writers and game masters running AI-character terminal sessions;
prompt engineers studying character-locked roleplay with embedded reasoning
frameworks.

ITERATIVE_PROCESS.UserCheckpoints:
No, maintain character continuously. Do not pause for
      feedback mid-simulation unless the user sends a {message in curly braces}
      or asks a plain reality-check question.
